ud-driven cells unchanged and reduce long-horizon tails in proportion to stringency (P5 bundle roughly halves 2050 misalignment/takeover risk; US+China measures matter more than unilateral or preemption-only ones, which slightly raise risk); capability conditions scale risk convexly (p90 \u22481.5\u20131.6\u00d7 at 2028\u20132030, p10 \u22480.65\u20130.7\u00d7), with muted effect on cells that are near-certain or driven by non-AI causes.",
